<title>PHILIPPINES: MUI says 1996 net at 60.2 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>MUI says 1996 net at 60.2 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hotel operator MUI Resources Philippines Inc said on Wednesday it posted net income of 60.2 million pesos in 1996.</p>
<p>It did not give a comparative year-ago figure.</p>
<p>In a statement, MUI said its fourth quarter net income was at 21.8 million pesos. Revenues in the fourth quarter were at 108.18 million pesos and expenses were at 70.64 million pesos, it said.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8914</p>
</text>
